    {
      "id": "_github_workflows_ci_lint_job",
      "label": "Lint & Format (CI job)",
      "file_type": "code",
      "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml",
      "source_location": "jobs.lint",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Materializa a ref local de main antes do biome --changed, porque checkout de PR fica em HEAD destacado; usa --no-errors-on-unmatched porque push direto pra main sem diff n\u00e3o \u00e9 falha de lint."
    },
    {
      "id": "_github_workflows_ci_typecheck_job",
      "label": "Type Check (CI job)",
      "file_type": "code",
      "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml",
      "source_location": "jobs.typecheck",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Bloqueia merge (sem continue-on-error); gera o client do Prisma antes por ser depend\u00eancia de @repo/database no grafo turbo; NODE_OPTIONS eleva o heap porque o tsc do apps/app estoura os 2GB padr\u00e3o do runner."
    },
    {
      "id": "_github_workflows_ci_cosmos_graph_job",
      "label": "Grafo do Cosmos (CI job)",
      "file_type": "code",
      "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml",
      "source_location": "jobs.cosmos-graph",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "pnpm cosmos:graph check reprova n\u00f3 que afirma o que n\u00e3o existe ou entrega sem commit/teste/ficha SAFe \u2014 resposta ao audit de 2026-07-23, onde o grafo divergiu do c\u00f3digo em sil\u00eancio."
    },
    {
      "id": "_github_workflows_ci_schema_drift_job",
      "label": "Schema Drift Check (CI job)",
      "file_type": "code",
      "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml",
      "source_location": "jobs.schema-drift",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Aplica a cadeia de migrations num Postgres pgvector vazio e compara com prisma migrate diff --exit-code; banco de dev j\u00e1 est\u00e1 no formato final, por isso 61 tabelas tinham divergido sem ningu\u00e9m notar antes deste gate."
    },
    {
      "id": "_github_workflows_ci_test_job",
      "label": "Tests & Coverage (CI job)",
      "file_type": "code",
      "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml",
      "source_location": "jobs.test",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Usa imagem pgvector/pgvector (n\u00e3o postgres puro) porque as migrations criam extension vector; RUN_DB_TESTS=1 \u00e9 opt-in s\u00f3 deste job, que tem Postgres descart\u00e1vel."
    },
    {
      "id": "_github_workflows_ci_security_audit_job",
      "label": "Security Vulnerability Scan (CI job)",
      "file_type": "code",
      "source_file": ".github/workflows/ci.yml",
