      "rationale": "needs [lint, typecheck, test, security-audit, schema-drift, cosmos-graph]; exclui --filter=!email porque react-email@5.0.5 pina framer-motion, cujo motion-dom quebrou a main sem commit nenhum; NODE_OPTIONS eleva heap porque o type check do next build no apps/app estoura o padr\u00e3o."
    },
    {
